---
title: Button Event Counter - FreeRTOS Software Timers
---
sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant BTN as Button Task
    participant TMR as Long-Press Timer
    participant Q as Event Queue
    participant CNT as Counter Task
    participant LED as LEDs

    loop every 10 ms
        BTN->>BTN: PressDetector_Update()
        alt press edge
            BTN->>Q: xQueueSend(EVENT_PRESS)
            BTN->>TMR: xTimerStart(1000 ms)
        else release
            BTN->>TMR: xTimerStop()
        end
    end

    alt timer fires while button held
        TMR->>Q: xQueueSend(EVENT_LONG_PRESS)
    end

    loop forever
        CNT->>Q: xQueueReceive(timeout 10 ms)
        alt event received
            CNT->>CNT: press -> increment / long-press -> reset
        end
        CNT->>LED: CounterDisplay_Show(pressed, count)
    end